            <ArticleTitle>[Immunological reactions to lipoproteins and heparin in young men with a hereditary tendency to arteriosclerosis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>58-61</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Among young men with hereditary tendency to atherosclerosis one frequently finds immunological reactions to serum lipoproteins of very low density, somewhat less frequent reactions to heparin are encountered. Possible mechanisms of actions of antibodies to lipoproteins and heparin are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
